@host = https://localhost:7285

### 1. Crear datos de prueba
POST {{host}}/api/products/seed

### 2. Ver estado inicial
GET {{host}}/api/products

### 3. Baseline: update de forma fija
PATCH {{host}}/api/products/1/fixed
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 135
}

### 4. Reiniciar datos
POST {{host}}/api/products/reset

### 5. Dynamic ExecuteUpdate: solo Price
PATCH {{host}}/api/products/1/dynamic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "price": 140
}

### 6. Verificar resultado
GET {{host}}/api/products

### 7. Reiniciar datos
POST {{host}}/api/products/reset

### 8. Dynamic ExecuteUpdate: Name + Stock
PATCH {{host}}/api/products/1/dynamic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mechanical Keyboard Pro",
  "stock": 25
}

### 9. Verificar resultado
GET {{host}}/api/products

### 10. Reiniciar datos
POST {{host}}/api/products/reset

### 11. Dynamic ExecuteUpdate: solo IsActive
PATCH {{host}}/api/products/2/dynamic
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

### 12. Caso borde: request sin cambios
PATCH {{host}}/api/products/1/dynamic
Content-Type: application/json

{}
